OL,3,GNEWSAFerry firm apologises for 'shaky
OL,4,Astart' to new route
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ferry company has apologised
OL,7,Ffollowing a "slightly shaky start" to
OL,8,Fan amended route.
OL,10,FBrittany Ferries said its new schedule
OL,11,Fmeant it could bring supplies to
OL,12,FGuernsey seven days a week, in a bid to
OL,13,Fbetter improve and support the island's
OL,14,Fbusinesses and wider economy.
OL,16,FDeputy Sasha Kazantseva-Miller said the
OL,17,Fcompany had provided an "excellent
OL,18,Fservice" since it took over in 2024,
OL,19,Fbut added the Committee for Economic
OL,20,FDevelopment was aware a small number of
OL,21,Ftrailers had been delayed on certain
OL,22,Fsailings over the past week.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
